The drawing code in this folder (head.tsx, hair.tsx, hat.tsx, eyes.tsx, mouth.tsx, shirt.tsx and the
layout in Drawing.tsx) is adapted from react-nice-avatar 1.5.0, https://github.com/dapi-labs/react-nice-avatar,
tag v1.5.0, commit 4cae947ee696bc09f986989b10b0a3db6a27360f, under the licence below.

The drawings are the Avatar Illustration System by Micah Lanier, licensed under CC BY 4.0
(https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by/4.0/), changed: redrawn in code by react-nice-avatar, then laid out
again and limited in colour by Gathr.

